WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
 You can also create a loop that just takes any box that are registered and

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:08.060
 ask it to only add a solution so that you can approve it upfront.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.060
 I don't have any loop that auto-merge anything because I want to have a

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.900
 clear view of every pull request.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.520
 I don't want to merge anything that I don't know what's going on.

